<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Prestasi to proceed with rights offer.</title>
<headline>Prestasi to proceed with rights offer.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prestasi Financial Services Ltd said on Friday it would proceed with a rights offer to raise about nine million rand.</p>
<p>In terms of the offer, Prestasi would offer some 8.6 million shares of one cent each in the ratio of 10 new shares for every 100 held at an issue price of 105 cents per share.</p>
<p>The purpose of the rights offer was to enable the company to expand its product range, including the establishment of a unit trust.</p>
<p>The last day to register for the offer would be November 8, it said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
